 3.356.83 4.73c.078.443-.36.79-.746.592L8 13.187l-4.389 2.256z"></path></svg><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="22px" height="22px" fill="#F3C753FF" class="r-d0mdtu" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M3.612 15.443c-.386.198-.824-.149-.746-.592l.83-4.73L.173 6.765c-.329-.314-.158-.888.283-.95l4.898-.696L7.538.792c.197-.39.73-.39.927 0l2.184 4.327 4.898.696c.441.062.612.636.282.95l-3.522 3.356.83 4.73c.078.443-.36.79-.746.592L8 13.187l-4.389 2.256z"></path></svg></div><div data-rid="a4d05fc0-4291-411b-ac03-6d199347caac" class="r-nsmldv"><div data-rid="0dc27e87-ef14-4237-b25c-a6c65e1ae3d0" class="r-cetlgj alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>"I love this cooler so much I am buying one for everyone in my family for Christmas. This is the only soft side cooler I have ever used that does not leak and it is fabulous to take on a trip where you don't have much room for extra gear!"</p></span></div><div data-rid="1a405b27-d2c0-4561-80d5-884b43ff2aa1" class="r-1d2ktbx alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>— Denise F.</p></span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="3249e875-ca6c-49c0-80f5-f54fd2c52b94" class="r-1d0g963"><div data-rid="78e4d4f9-49b1-4b98-86d6-bc78185e5651" class="r-wrv6ts"><div data-rid="39810cdb-1f83-4325-9131-608145e30812" class="r-y9u6li"><div data-rid="91abd9a2-af6b-4ee6-aaac-57a9846e1a64" class="r-1mx783p alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>STEP ONE</p></span></div><div data-rid="33f3f14a-1a35-4815-9818-ab1042b3335f" class="r-915oey alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>01</p></span></div><div data-rid="380dc075-e6d2-440d-81ab-1834192bcf22" class="r-1agnf8u alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><h3>Packs into Itself</h3></span></div><div data-rid="ddfe2aac-e7d9-4d9f-aed6-0165003b3c93" class="r-5lrqxg alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>The Original Puffy Cooler™ folds into its built-in stuff-sack in seconds and is smaller than a hoodie. Toss it in your carry-on, purse, or daypack so it's always ready when plans turn into adventures.</p></span></div></div><div data-rid="bf6d97c0-d9fd-4a6e-8e08-81adb5b2da64" class="r-1x9soim"><picture data-rid="f5d475aa-4828-4361-b49c-ca14123ba616" class="r-1si7r5b"><source srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1805/4637/files/IMG_6528.jpg?v=1754412783&amp;width=820" media="(max-width: 640px)"/><source srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1805/4637/files/IMG_6528.jpg?v=1754412783&amp;width=1024" media="(min-width: 641px) and (max-width: 1024px)"/><source srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1805/4637/files/IMG_6528.jpg?v=1754412783&amp;width=1800" media="(min-width: 1025px) and (max-width: 2400px)"/><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1805/4637/files/IMG_6528.jpg?v=1754412783" class="r-c0nxxx" loading="eager"/></picture></div></div><div data-rid="80cbb3f4-4abe-4663-b4f8-1a61c954b1d2" class="r-5hh8gl"><div data-rid="144b036f-ce82-4c99-90aa-9c6974cc0ada" class="r-1g91rpx"><picture data-rid="2e7a3417-25ac-48fb-9efe-6055c9e6784b" class="r-1mc7714"><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/909f253a-05c9-4a3e-a93d-322a013cae9f/c2072688-25c9-4329-ba55-f20f01a143a7?width=820" media="(max-width: 640px)"/><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/909f253a-05c9-4a3e-a93d-322a013cae9f/c2072688-25c9-4329-ba55-f20f01a143a7?width=1024" media="(min-width: 641px) and (max-width: 1024px)"/><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/909f253a-05c9-4a3e-a93d-322a013cae9f/c2072688-25c9-4329-ba55-f20f01a143a7?width=1800" media="(min-width: 1025px) and (max-width: 2400px)"/><img src="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/909f253a-05c9-4a3e-a93d-322a013cae9f/c2072688-25c9-4329-ba55-f20f01a143a7" alt="Person with puffy white backpack stands by grassy waterfront, smiling under a tree." class="r-1d1x5nm" loading="eager"/></picture></div><div data-rid="30156d9b-6e0d-48d8-bb3a-42f8b096eee8" class="r-5l5ph"><div data-rid="6976ffd9-615a-468a-9864-de19b20a1d91" class="r-13xia4i alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>STEP TWO</p></span></div><div data-rid="1f21da4c-fbdf-41f2-8e3d-c42b963dbc72" class="r-99x6bb alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>02</p></span></div><div data-rid="a7f54e9e-54ae-4219-b6b7-9944870e02ab" class="r-1rj0hw alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><h3>Carry Anywhere</h3></span></div><div data-rid="495d8510-39a4-4806-a0dd-2d7a0655bace" class="r-1xmab9s alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Ultralight, soft, and packable, so you can bring a real cooler without the bulk. It slides under seats, hangs off a stroller, and stows in the overhead bin so you can chill on the fly.</p></span></div></div></div><div data-rid="990b36d3-52e9-46cb-b9af-7a7ea5ff840c" class="r-56lk65"><div data-rid="b624e8b4-3ff7-485f-a2b8-ccfa35a89089" class="r-1ah9vaj"><div data-rid="3f8b401f-f102-4b65-ae48-6d47b5196656" class="r-1bg1kg8 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>STEP THREE</p></span></div><div data-rid="c20a41e2-70ea-416f-b623-94c593367db7" class="r-16tmwvx alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>03</p></span></div><div data-rid="633f44b5-6a37-48e7-9868-21ec9978cf91" class="r-qeuh99 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><h3>Keep Drinks Cold Up To 55 Hours</h3></span></div><div data-rid="e80b5538-ce90-46d6-abac-2ee6ae2dc51b" class="r-1bf4xv4 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Load it up and go. <strong>Outdoor Life</strong> found <strong>Monti</strong> keeps ice for 55 hours, longer than you’d expect from a cooler this light, so your last drink is as cold as your first.</p></span></div></div><div data-rid="497ac26f-cad1-4d33-9db7-d784cfe9eae7" class="r-t2brh7"><picture data-rid="35e1db5d-ac5f-4836-9b2e-21c01e725dab" class="r-7kx9t2"><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/909f253a-05c9-4a3e-a93d-322a013cae9f/bca90f6a-c909-4e1e-9dba-2d3d51216dc8?width=820" media="(max-width: 640px)"/><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/909f253a-05c9-4a3e-a93d-322a013cae9f/bca90f6a-c909-4e1e-9dba-2d3d51216dc8?width=1024" media="(min-width: 641px) and (m